{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/9","id":4900283262,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVMrF8s8AAAABJBRjfg","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/9","diff_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/9.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/9.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/issues/9","number":9,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Expose duplicate sitemap URLs with reproducible alpha 2 evidence","user":{"login":"tsm0420","id":62269874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjY5ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62269874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nAn exported sitemap could repeat a URL and still pass the technical audit. The alpha 2 candidate adds exact XML-decoded duplicate evidence and preserves the core's local-input scope.\n\n```text\nsupported local sitemap\n  decode XML references once\n  count exact URL strings and entry positions\n  duplicates -> failed finding / exit 1\n  unique URLs -> pass\nunsupported sitemap -> duplicates unknown\n```\n\nCloses #8 when merged. Relates to #7; its upstream limitation remains unresolved and that issue stays open. This PR does not publish or tag alpha 2.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** real CLI duplicate fixture returned exit 0; numeric references produced wrong URL identities/counts. Red receipts are committed.\n  **After:** typecheck, all 33 CLI tests (including subtests), and build pass. Independent Standards and Spec reviews report zero actionable introduced defects.\n- Frozen YinThread input: 146 entries, 145 unique URLs, day-master at positions 8 and 12; exit 1, with schema semantics and live indexing still unknown. Capture and historical report bytes are unchanged.\n- Official registry/source evidence confirms no compatible published Cheerio upgrade removes the transitive warning. No override is applied; UTF-8/HTML decoding has a real CLI regression.\n- Clean committed-source install/typecheck/33-test suite/build passed at `071c591948c5265afdf674ef9ecf8d1e988bbd2e`. The extracted package installed its own dependencies and passed help/init/install/audit/aso/plan/visibility plus the expected failing frozen-case audit. All 22 packaged files match the final checkout.\n- Local candidate: `0.1.0-alpha.2`, 19,472 bytes, SHA-256 `cdefcda140b6e7c388dc0839d4349b076fc51e37f738f98d9924ec19ff38e790`. The package is retained locally; no release is published. Raw commands, exits and file hashes are in [`docs/verification/alpha-2/`](https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/tree/1c8c535bcf00739ae705bdb9e2d3a455717a45f4/docs/verification/alpha-2).\n- Final PR head `1c8c535bcf00739ae705bdb9e2d3a455717a45f4` passed [CI run 39035188280](https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/actions/runs/39035188280), confirmed by the Code Review plugin with the exact head and untruncated job log. The final commit changes verification/ticket documents only; executable, test and packaged inputs are unchanged from the locally verified source.\n\nReadiness: ready for external alpha review, with the explicitly unresolved upstream warning in #7. No growth, indexing, production-readiness or sponsorship claim.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** audit\n\nSitemaps with duplicates now produce exit 1; consumers may need to handle this actionable finding in CI. Report data gains an additive sitemap summary. No production edits, live requests, paid sampling, merge or publication.\n","created_at":"2026-10-17T13:04:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T13:07:21Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c74b9a47e6a52e433d6369a16d70b7ba3c20b999","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/9/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/9/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/issues/9/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/statuses/1c8c535bcf00739ae705bdb9e2d3a455717a45f4","head":{"label":"tsm0420:codex/alpha-2-candidate","ref":"codex/alpha-2-candidate","sha":"1c8c535bcf00739ae705bdb9e2d3a455717a45f4","user":{"login":"tsm0420","id":62269874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjY5ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62269874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/events{/privacy}","rece